# 15_ganzflicker_imagery.ledc — Ganzflicker Imagery, ~20 min — 10 Hz eyes-closed flicker journey
# Technique: sustained 10 Hz eyes-closed flicker to evoke Kluver form-constants (geometric
#            imagery, vivid color). 10 Hz is the empirically strongest flicker-imagery rate
#            and sits BELOW the photosensitive danger band. A +/-0.5 Hz "floating frequency"
#            micro-drift (Lucia-style) keeps the percept alive. Flicker uses a GENTLE SINE
#            gate (env=1, playbook B2 — softer edges, far less fatigue than a hard square).
# Bands: induction alpha 10 Hz; imagery hold ~10 Hz with +/-0.5 Hz float (9.5<->10.5 Hz).
# (For a warm eyes-closed Ganzfeld field biased amber/red per eyelid transmission, see the
#  sibling 31_ganzfeld_amber.ledc; this file is the cool-white FLICKER variant.)
#
# SAFETY / CONTRAINDICATIONS:
#   Do NOT use if you have photosensitive epilepsy, a seizure disorder, or a history of
#   photic migraine. Do not use while driving. Experiential, not medical.
#   Flicker LOCKED in the 8-12 Hz bright-safe imagery band the whole session — never 13 Hz+
#   (well clear of the 15-25 Hz photosensitive strobe band). Brightness capped <=30%
#   (breathing 25-30%). No saturated-red strobe, no red<->blue alternation (cool white only).
#   Brightness ramps IN 15 s and fades OUT 240 s; isochronic carrier 200 Hz (<1000).
#   Single session <=~20 min per research.
#
# Driver: ISOCHRONIC 10 Hz audio partner (audio `mod` = beat Hz; 200 Hz carrier), locked
#   1:1 with the light flicker (they float together via matching ~ LFOs on LED freq + audio mod).
# LED columns: time freq duty bright R G B mask [env]   (env 1 = gentle sine gate; mask 15 = 4 zones)
# Ramp convention = animate-on-start (the > prefix sits where a segment BEGINS).

# --- Induction (00:00-04:00, 10 Hz): vol + light fade in ---
0 10 50 >0 200 220 255 15 1   # LED 10 Hz cool white, gentle sine gate; brightness ramps 0->30% over 15 s
A 0 200 0 >0 10 1                  # isochronic: 200 Hz carrier pulsed at 10 Hz; vol fades 0->50 over 60 s
S 3000 default 10 "Let your eyes rest closed and soften your gaze."
15000 10 50 30 200 220 255 15 1   # brightness reaches 30% cap (ramp-in >=15 s done)
30000 10 50 ~25:30:10000 200 220 255 15 1   # breathing brightness LFO 25<->30% over 10 s
A 60000 200 0 100 10 1              # vol settled 50, beat holds 10 Hz

# --- Imagery hold (04:00-16:00, ~10 Hz with +/-0.5 Hz floating drift) ---
240000 ~9.5:10.5:8000 50 ~25:30:10000 200 220 255 15 1   # LED freq floats 9.5<->10.5 Hz (8 s/cycle), sine gate
A 240000 200 0 100 ~9.5:10.5:8000 1   # isochronic beat floats 9.5<->10.5 Hz, locked 1:1 with the light
S 240000 default 10 "Watch the geometric shapes and colors begin to form."
S 480000 default 10 "Let the patterns move and shift — just observe, without holding on."
S 720000 default 10 "Colors and forms arise on their own. Stay with them, at ease."

# --- Soft fade (16:00-20:00): flicker settles to 10 Hz, brightness + vol fade to 0 over 4 min ---
960000 10 50 >30 200 220 255 15 1   # float ends, steady 10 Hz; brightness fades 30->0 over 240 s
A 960000 200 0 >100 10 1            # beat settles to 10 Hz; vol fades 50->0 over 240 s
S 960000 default 10 "Gently returning now. Let the images fade."
1200000 10 50 0 200 220 255 15 1   # end: brightness 0
A 1200000 200 0 0 10 1             # end: volume 0

S 1200000 default 20 "WAKE UP!"
S 1210000 default 40 "WAKE UP!"
S 1220000 default 50 "WAKE UP!"
S 1230000 default 60 "WAKE UP!"
